{"id":517,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"補習と学習支援で基礎と自学力を支える","feature_description":"穎明館は中学内容を中学2年修了まで、高校内容を高校2年修了までに学ぶ進度を示し、授業時数は標準の1.5～2倍と案内しています。中学1・2年では小テストで基礎の定着を図り、定期試験の結果に応じて補習を実施。中学のEMK未来サポートや放課後の自習環境を設け、家庭学習の習慣を身につける方針です。中学1・2年は全員登録、中3以上は希望制です。","clubs":[{"id":10137,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10139,"name":"中学サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10140,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10141,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10142,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10143,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10144,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10145,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10146,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10148,"name":"中学男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10149,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10150,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10151,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.emk.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10152,"name":"かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https:/